  "name": "Voxel ship",
  "doc": "A space_sim ship (.vox) as instanced cubes on a starfield, orbited by the camera. Each slice along the hull glows with its spectrum band; onsets and bass blow the voxels apart and they settle back. The exemplar for using vendored assets: declare them in assets, read them with asset(), parse with parseVox/voxWorld.",
